{"parse": {"title": "TTS-11", "pageid": 141715, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-10\" title=\"TTS-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-11</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-12\" title=\"TTS-12\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">11</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.BC.AB.E6.B8.B8.E5.BC.8F.E5.BB.BA.E7.AD.91\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"漫游式建筑\">漫游式建筑</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 漫游式建筑</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Promenade Architecturale</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>迎<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>亲<span class=\"color-value\"></span>爱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>新<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>房<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>热<span class=\"color-value\"></span>茶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>覆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>盆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>热<span class=\"color-value\"></span>茶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810111</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1996年5月8日</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天气 晴</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今天是穹顶项目施工的第16天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>施工过程总是伴随无数的意外。回声石的数量远比预估的要少，我们拆掉一面墙，通常只能得到几块完整可用的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，我们不得不将居民区的墙壁也一并拆除。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_09\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-3_8_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-3_8_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-3_8_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>曾在某些居民床头静静安睡的回声石，现在躺在了推车里，被一筐筐运送过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>监工则站在一旁，认真地在小本上刷刷记录着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>四十八、四十九、五十……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>这样应该就集齐了所需的全部回声石，等奠基石在设计方面解决好进光量的问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>再搭好第一阶段的模型，就可以正式开始修建穹顶了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她合上文件夹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>很抱歉，奥尔加女士……拆除居民区的墙壁本不在我们的规划内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>没关系。那些石头晚上吵得人睡不着觉，拆了正好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>反正你们之后会提供免费的材料，给我们修好新墙，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>嗯……这是当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>当初提出这个方案，我还以为你们会毫不犹豫地拒绝，或是要求更多补贴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老人笑着摆摆手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>没有的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>大伙儿虽然表面不说，但心里都盼望着能早早见到穹顶落成的那一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>人就是这样……事情做久了，慢慢就会把它当成自己的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>监工愣了愣，像是从未想过这种可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我好像从未从这个角度想过——对我来说，这只是一个项目，可对你们来说……这是你们每天生活的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>现在看来，我对你们似乎一直缺乏了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>可你已经和大家好好聊过了，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图一怔，然后笑了起来，神色轻松。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>谢谢你们。以及，我向你们保证：作为补偿，我会给你们修一面更牢固、更安静的墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>接下来，我需要和奠基石同步一下这边的进展……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她急匆匆地转过身，朝着左边走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>走另一边，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>建筑师在居民住宅区——我的意思是，新的住宅区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>听说那里有些小小的采光问题，所以大家请她过去看看。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_25.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_25\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_25\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_5_bg_25.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_25.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_5_bg_25.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_25.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_5_bg_25.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_25.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>嗯……我之前预估过这里的光照水平。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但没想到会阴暗到这种程度——我几乎什么都看不见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-649210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>临时搭建的居民区，没人敢随便在墙壁上打洞开窗，所以才来找你帮忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>听说你们带回来的那位……会发光的小姐，也被安置在里面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我知道，卢齐安甚至自告奋勇做起了她的“看守”……当然，我猜他只是找到了一个不必与我每天讨论咖啡水粉比的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谈话的间隙，建筑师注意到不远处一团隐约发光的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那是……电视机？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她好奇地朝着光源走去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_18\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-3_8_bg_18.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-3_8_bg_18.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-3_8_bg_18.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314518.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-314518.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314518.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314518.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-314518.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314518.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-314518.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314518.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣与卢齐安并排坐在地上，两双眼睛紧盯着电视机的屏幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她身体里涌动着朦胧的色光，与屏幕荧光遥相对望，如同一对在灰暗洋流中蛰伏的发光水母。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>卢齐安先生，请解释一下——这就是你所说的“看守”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢齐安：</div><div>我正在看守她，只是“顺便”看会儿电视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩显然有些心不在焉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢齐安：</div><div>……而且她选的节目，还挺不错的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师顺着两人的目光看向屏幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怪诞的木偶剧里，一个男人掀开脑袋，将一条鱼放了进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-314512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-314512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-314512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>噗嗤，真有意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-314523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-314523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-314523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>如果小洪扎也在就好了，我们还可以一起向这些木偶学习……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提及伙伴，少女再度陷入深重的忧郁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不必如此追求进步。相信我，你们现在的表现已经足够让人夜里做噩梦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>更何况……你确定要给小洪扎来个像这样的开颅手术吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>&amp;#￥%……？那是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个对她而言过分复杂的概念词组。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她显然觉得话里藏着更危险的暗示，眼神不断往建筑师空着的手上飘去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你那位吵吵闹闹的同伙现在不在我身边。放心吧，它很安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>等设计稿出来我会放它自由——就像我们之前说好的那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说完，建筑师从电视机前离开，在室内转了几圈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个狭长的房间，空间从门口一直延伸到尽头的窗户，中间几乎没有转折。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灶台、水槽还守在原位，沿着墙面排开，只留下一条窄窄的通道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>原来这是经由厨房改造的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我记得小时候，我们一家人也是蜗居在这样的小厨房里看电视、读书。我们会读很多书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>是吗？我还以为在你这样的大建筑师眼里，这恐怕是最糟糕的环境了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不，恰恰相反。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>昏暗的走道，逼仄的空间，挤在一起看电视的人们……它让我感受到了人的韧性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>在极度恶劣的条件中经营着生活，这本就令人尊重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>关于这里的采光，我有一个建议……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_17.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_17\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_17\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-3_8_bg_17.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_17.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-3_8_bg_17.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_17.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-3_8_bg_17.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_17.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>厨房中央的天花板被拆卸掉了，露出一角灰蓝色的天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>喔，这样就明亮多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>小时候，我住在灰色的筒子楼里。那是一间狭小的房子，天花板低得像随时要塌下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>每天我都会去楼下的秋千处，只有在那里，才能感受到一点稀薄的阳光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那时候我就想——如果有一天，我能拆掉屋顶，让天光一直留在屋里……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_07\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-3_8_at_07.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-3_8_at_07.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-3_8_at_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">幼年奠基石：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">看，这样就能让天光一直留在屋里……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的童年是一个由灰构筑的梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天永远是灰蓝色的，像一张未洗净的底片。楼房一栋接一栋，灰白的立面在薄雾中若隐若现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而在那些灰色中，亦有一线光亮存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-653602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗莎：</div><div>真漂亮……就像圣索菲亚大教堂那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>真没意思，我不喜欢这个！我喜欢阴暗的房子。我讨厌太阳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">幼年奠基石：</div><div>没问题，我来涂掉门窗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>还有我，还有我！我要一个晚上可以看到星星的屋顶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-654203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">幼年奠基石：</div><div>好……就让星星永远闪烁在埃米尔的屋顶上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笑声在空旷的楼宇间回荡，一切都柔软而迟缓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩在大家的环绕下，用铅笔描出一幢又一幢方正的楼房——一样的外立面、一样的阳台、一样的拒人千里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当黑白的线条出现，灰色的世界开始有了呼吸。那是独属于她和朋友们的、尚未建成的梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在重复的形状里，找到了一种奇异的平静。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_17.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_17\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_17\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-3_8_bg_17.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_17.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-3_8_bg_17.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_17.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-3_8_bg_17.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_17.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>让天光一直留在屋里，就很好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>原来……小时候我也曾画过类似的结构。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>只不过，那时候的设计更加异想天开——我将屋顶抬得更高，甚至还做了新的带形窗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>就像圣索菲亚大教堂那样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师忽然陷入沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>怎么了，大建筑师？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石站在新改造的厨房中央，抬头望着新设计出来的天窗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如果我们提升部分屋盖，在屋盖与墙体之间形成一条环绕的空间，让光从侧边滑入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这样的话，我们或许可以得到一些更为均匀、柔和的光线……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她喃喃道，忽然有了想法。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手指轻轻挥舞，眼前便凭空出现了一组材料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一部分作为撬杆，逐段抬起被切开的屋盖；而另一部分，则作为加高框架，被塞入、固定于其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>嗯……看起来没有任何偏移或不适配的情况，所有的组件都能精准嵌入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>接下来我们就可以安装了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她手中又变出几块薄玻璃，将它们固定在墙顶与屋盖之间开好的连续窗框上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>咔哒——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_11\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_at_11.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_at_11.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_at_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当最后一块玻璃安装上去的那一刻，光从顶部温和、匀亮地涌入厨房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>锅具、蒸汽炉……每个角落都被照亮，每个人的侧脸都被描出柔和的金线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>就像现在这样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢齐安：</div><div>噢……光像瀑布一样流下来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>没错。光不是来自上方，而是来自侧边，就像圣索菲亚大教堂那样。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这个方案如果平移到穹顶的话，就应该是这样的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师低声自语，手中的笔尖在速写本上飞速勾勒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>回声谣小姐，从中庭的穹顶流淌下来的，也是像这样的光吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将新的穹顶草图交到回声谣手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女拿起手中的稿纸，一步步走到天窗下，光和影子在她脚边游走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指尖掠过芦荟的叶片，阳光在那抹绿色上缓慢起伏，如同有了生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许久以后，她才抬起头，望向头顶那一圈柔和的光线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>哦……是光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>好久不见。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-11"}}